                ]
            ]
        },
        {
            "block_label": "text",
            "block_content": "c. For holidays only, employees covered by this Agreement shall be allowed to utilize their maximum of eighty (80) hours of holiday benefits in either ten (10) hour or eight (8) hour increments. Holidays shall be paid in accordance with the Collective Bargaining Agreement.",
